          "from": "PIE *bʰréh₂tēr 'brother'",
          "to": "братръ (bratrŭ), братъ (bratŭ)",
          "note": "Via Proto-Balto-Slavic *brā́ˀtē and Proto-Slavic *bràtrъ; *bʰ merged with *b throughout Balto-Slavic."
